Apache-2.0. Original: Copyright contributors to the vLLM project.
Vendored from vllm-project/vllm @ 53181384e036cc660ff6754c8a94a8e6d0b60562
(2026-05-11), csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/w8a8/cutlass/:
  c3x/scaled_mm_blockwise_sm120_fp8.cu          -> scaled_mm_blockwise_sm120_fp8.cu
  c3x/scaled_mm_blockwise_sm120_fp8_dispatch.cuh -> scaled_mm_blockwise_sm120_fp8_dispatch.cuh
